The original release provenance describes fictional business facts and generated utterances based on anonymized service-call skeletons. All demonstration speech is synthesized. The 20 customer-turn audio clips illustrate vocal contrasts; multi-turn evaluation synthesizes customer speech at runtime.

Historical asset-generation metadata is preserved as supplied. The synthetic offline runtime example uses generated test responses and is explicitly labelled; it carries no commercial-model performance measurement. Scenario content remains separately licensed when referenced by an example.

